  "content": "<h1>雲杉威利斯聖誕樹</h1><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.tophatcat.dev%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-16181C?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=5865F2\" alt=\"Discord 徽章\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spruce-willis-the-xmas-tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-16181C?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=FF784D\" alt=\"CurseForge 徽章\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fspruce-willis-the-xmas-tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-16181C?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=17B85A\" alt=\"Modrinth 徽章\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbsky.app%252fprofile%252ftophatcat.dev\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Bluesky-16181C?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=bluesky&amp;logoColor=1185FE\" alt=\"Bluesky 徽章\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/kiris-mods/spruce-willis-the-xmas-tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/GitHub-16181C?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=BBDDE5\" alt=\"Github 徽章\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftophatcat.dev%252fmods%252fspruce-willis-the-xmas-tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/tophatcat.dev-16181C?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=&amp;logoColor=57Z29S\" alt=\"網站徽章\"></a></p><p>布魯斯已進化成雲杉威利斯聖誕樹！<br>\n這是一個在 2019 年冬季遊戲創作節期間製作的小型模組！</p><p>又到了一年一度的這個時候，我們需要一棵新的聖誕樹來放置禮物！所以讓我們去看看能否在森林中捕捉到一棵正在遊蕩的樹！<br>\n令人驚訝的是，當對雲杉威利斯使用骨粉時，或當閃電擊中它時，威利斯爺爺會被召喚出來。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/489/484/spruce_willis.png\" alt=\"展示雲杉威利斯和威利斯爺爺聖誕樹的圖片\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1462/402/spruce-and-grandfather-willis-2-png.png\" alt=\"展示雲杉威利斯和威利斯爺爺聖誕樹的圖片\"></p>",
